Q: Is it possible to integrate paypal payments as guest without the smart buttons or how to implement the buttons securely? A: <p>I made that, using the v2 of paypal orders api on laravel. And the only option i see is to log in or if user hasnt an account there is the option to pay and create an account at the same time. But cant see the way to just allow ser to only pay with debit/credit card:</p>
<pre><code>                $response = Http::withHeaders([
                    'Authorization' =&gt; 'Bearer ' . $token,
                ])-&gt;post($this-&gt;baseUrl . '/v2/checkout/orders', [
                            'intent' =&gt; 'CAPTURE',
                            'purchase_units' =&gt; [
                                [
                                    'amount' =&gt; [
                                        'currency_code' =&gt; session('currency'),
                                        'value' =&gt; number_format($payAmount, 2, '.', ''),
                                    ]
                                ]
                            ],
                            'payment_source' =&gt; [
                                'paypal' =&gt; [
                                    'experience_context' =&gt; [
                                        'payment_method_preference' =&gt; $preference,
                                        'landing_page' =&gt; $landing,
                                        'shipping_preference' =&gt; 'NO_SHIPPING',
                                        'user_action' =&gt; 'PAY_NOW',
                                        'return_url' =&gt; url('get-success'),
                                        'cancel_url' =&gt; url('payment-error'),
                                    ],
                                ],
                            ],
                        ]);
</code></pre>
